  "prefLabel": "Par 104.02 Confidentiality",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Par 104.02 Confidentiality. In order to protect parolees from injurious publicity parole records shall be kept confidential. Those records shall be exempt from the provisions of the New Hampshire Right-to-Know Law by RSA 91-A:5, II.\n\nSource. #7148, eff 12-7-99 (from Par 103.02); ss by #12157, eff 4-7-17",
